@startuml flow-fetch
title Fetch, group & live-poll
skinparam shadowing false
participant DashboardView as D
participant "MailService (Gmail/Outlook)" as M
participant "MailDomain.group" as G

D -> M : fetch(token, depth, ctx) on a virtual thread
M -> M : list received-mail IDs newest-first (paged, up to depth)
note right of M
  Gmail: q = -in:sent -in:chats
  Outlook: inbox + archive folders, merged
  (no sent / drafts / junk / trash)
end note
M -> M : fetch each message concurrently (≤12 in flight)
M --> D : onMessage(EmailMessage) — every message is kept
M --> D : onProgress(x / y) — live progress bar
loop every 250ms while fetching
  D -> G : group all messages by domain
  G --> D : domains
  D -> D : apply search + sort + heat colour → render cards
end
note over D, M
  After the first load, poll every 5s (shallow);
  ctx.shouldFetch skips already-seen IDs (cheap)
end note
@enduml
